{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1078788-simple-second-sight-update","id":1078788,"title":"Simple Second Sight Update","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-15T00:06:16-07:00","id":1078788,"title":"Simple Second Sight Update","content":"So, I went through my Second Sight book and updated as many merits as I could into 2nd edition Supernatural merits, mostly just for the fun of it, but perhaps to allow my players in a couple of games I take part in to use. I'd like a bit of feedback though, as they're not all direct 1 to 1 conversions (especially where ephemeral entities are involved). You can find it here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1KvucVZkQNNSiM-MkTUJQqZSuRTeI1cAuIMubXqGUXq8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Second Sight Conversions</a>.<br /> <br /> To note, I didn't convert anything that has an equivalent already, for obvious reasons, or a few things that I just dislike being a thing to begin with.<br /> <br /> Obviously, I consolidated Psychic Merits and Thaumaturgy into just both being supernatural merits, and only bothered with one version where appropriate. In a couple cases, I renamed them so they don't match either one, too.<br /> I also did my best to remove the prerequisite chains that everybody hated, but a few I kept a single prerequisite merit for, or provided a few different options instead of a chain of needed merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault sup